            "label": "From South Africa",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Zembrin®",
            "source": "Sceletium tortuosum",
            "body": "<p>A small, hardy succulent that grows out of cracks in the South African desert. People there have used it for generations to calm the mind without flattening it.</p><p>In studies, it gently shifts mood and reaction time — without acting like a stimulant. The no-jitter part starts here.</p>",
            "nick": "The calm in the capsule."
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg class=\"leaf-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M10 30 C20 18, 40 18, 50 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M10 30 C20 42, 40 42, 50 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#B89968\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "From the Amazon",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Amatea® Max",
            "source": "Ilex guayusa",
            "body": "<p>A wild caffeinated holly tree from the Amazon. Indigenous communities have brewed its leaves at dawn for centuries — what they call <em>\"the awake plant.\"</em></p><p>It brings polyphenols and antioxidants along with it. So the lift comes with protection.</p>",
            "nick": "The wake-up, without the wired."
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg class=\"leaf-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A7148\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M30 16 Q24 30 30 44 Q36 30 30 16 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A7148\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#8A7148\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "From organic green coffee beans",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Caffeine",
            "source": "Coffea arabica",
            "body": "<p>Z-83 uses just enough clean, plant-derived caffeine — pulled from organic green coffee beans, no synthetic stuff, no mycotoxins.</p><p>It's there to leave you focused, energized, and lit — without overdoing the stimulation. The dose is small, on purpose.</p>",
            "nick": "The whisper. Not the shout."
          }
        }
